      "raw": "<p>Hey everyone, if this has been addressed somewhere can someone just point me to it, because I haven&#39;t seen anything about it. In the recent kickstarter update, as well as the State of Game post a few days ago, it was stated that nothing was shipping to backers yet. Well, I backed the OblivAeon project at The Entire Multiverse level and received a box in the mail <em><strong>today</strong></em>.</p><p>https://imgur.com/t13UNOG</p><p>Looks like I received the Core Game, Rook City &amp; Infernal Relics, Shattered Timelines &amp; Wrath of the Cosmos, Vengeance, Villains, The Foil hero card pack, Scholar, Unity, Guise, Chokepoint, Miss Information, Wager Master, Ambuscade, Silver Gulch, Ominitron IV, The Final Wasteland, Celestial Tribunal, an extra token pack, and the oversized villain cards pack.</p><p>I *think* this is all the pre-OblivAeon stuff (Please correct me if I&#39;m wrong). My question is, is this what&#39;s supposed to be happening and I&#39;m supposed to get this stuff now with the rest of it coming in another shipment later? Just kind of nervous that my order might be screwed up since it&#39;s been reiterated a few times that &quot;nothing!&quot; has been shipped to backers.</p>",
