      "id": 219008,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-11T20:26:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We sent out most of the \"everything ever\" shipments back in 2016. However, people who ordered later via BackerKit, or who updated their addresses after that ship deadline, had not had their stuff sent out until now. We have decided to send all of those now, before OblivAeon arrives, because it will make it faster to get OblivAeon out to all of the backers, even though we'll wind up paying a bit extra in shipping.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:51:13.416Z",
